{
  "comment": [
    "Kenney asset manifest (SPEC2 M12 stage 0, E-14/D-140/D-160). Pure text:",
    "pack URLs + SHA-256 pins for `npm run assets:fetch`, and the model-to-",
    "game mapping `npm run assets:bake` rasterises. The zip URLs embed a CMS",
    "media hash, so a Kenney re-upload changes URL AND checksum together -",
    "re-pin both from the pack's page when a fetch 404s.",
    "Mapping targets: `vehicle:<catalogId>` (8 facings),",
    "`building:<zone>:<stage>[:<variant>]`, `industry:<TypeName>` and",
    "`tree:<n>` (1 facing each). `scale` is model units to metres - an art",
    "choice per entry (vehicles ride ~1.7x over their catalogue lengthM so",
    "they read at 64 px/tile, the TTD convention). This M12 subset is",
    "REPRESENTATIVE; M13 completes the catalogue coverage.",
    "Company-colour zones (`tint`): `materials` lists glTF material names",
    "(the older kits, e.g. Nature Kit, carry named materials);",
    "`hues` marks every face whose resolved colour falls in a hue band,",
    "because the colormap kits paint a livery as a RAMP of shades around one",
    "hue inside a single 'colormap' material; `colors` pins exact #rrggbb",
    "patches. The bake renders zone faces neutral grey in the base cell and",
    "writes a mask cell whose grey value carries the NW shading - tinting",
    "the mask with a company colour multiplies to a shaded livery.",
    "Gaps stay procedural per E-14: aircraft (no Kenney 3D aircraft kit),",
    "buses (no bus model in the Car Kit), coal-mine headframe and oil",
    "derrick (no kit equivalent), and every dev build without a cache."
  ],
